  "bodyHash": "a0a4e46cdcc5a08f",
  "content": "\n\n<p>Quartz Arsenal 是一款针对 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Refined Storage</a> 的附加组件，添加了各种新工具。</p>\n<p>目前，它添加了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fwireless-crafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">无线合成网格</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fcreative-wireless-crafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">创造模式无线合成网格</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>无线合成网格</h2>\n<p>无线合成网格是 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fviewing-resources%252fcrafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成网格</a> 的无线版本。</p>\n<h3>使用方法</h3>\n<p>使用无线合成网格：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在任意存储网络设备上对其使用，以将其绑定到存储网络。</li>\n<li>确保存储网络中至少安装了一个 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fwireless-transmitter.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">无线发射器</a> 以维持连接。</li>\n<li>为无线合成网格充能，因为在打开界面、放入、取出或合成资源时会消耗能量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>快捷键</h3>\n<p>可设置一个未绑定的按键来打开无线合成网格。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
